[en.FOCUS_C04_THE_INVESTIGATION_TEAM]
Investigation Team

[en.FOCUS_C04_THE_INVESTIGATION_TEAM_desc]
Since the “Return to the Sky” plan is unlikely to be implemented in the short term, Sky Stinger had no choice but to order the disbandment of the assembled Wonderbolts and Sepal Militia. However, Vapor Trail suggested that a portion of the Sepal Militia could be retained and reorganized into an investigation team, specifically responsible for investigating the truth behind this incident. Or further, a long-term intelligence agency.

[en.FOCUS_C04_THE_INVESTIGATION_TEAM_TOOLTIP]
Unlock a series of decisions: §YThe Sepal Files: Root Cause§!.

[zh.FOCUS_C04_THE_INVESTIGATION_TEAM]
成立调查组

[zh.FOCUS_C04_THE_INVESTIGATION_TEAM_desc]
既然“重返天空”计划短期内没有再立即实现的可能，破空也只得下令解散原来集结的闪电天马与萼叶民兵。不过，雾轨提议，可以保留一部分萼叶民兵，改组成为调查组，专门负责调查此次事件的真相。或者更进一步，成为一个长期的情报机构。

[zh.FOCUS_C04_THE_INVESTIGATION_TEAM_TOOLTIP]
解锁系列决议：§Y萼叶档案：寻根究底§!。

